<h2>Common issues</h2>

<div class="sop-callout sop-callout--warn">
  <strong>They don't have photos and don't want stock</strong>
  Recommend a local photographer (we keep a referral list per metro). Half-day shoot is $400-700 typical. Schedule it FAST; build can't proceed without imagery.
</div>

<div class="sop-callout sop-callout--warn">
  <strong>They want to see "a few designs" before committing assets</strong>
  Polite firm: wireframes need their content. I can show generic component patterns from /samples/ but won't build a custom design for a non-client.
</div>

<div class="sop-callout sop-callout--warn">
  <strong>The agreement-signer is not the day-to-day contact</strong>
  Document who's who. Approvals on design must come from the agreement-signer in writing; daily communication can be the day-to-day contact. Avoid surprises at launch ("my husband doesn't like that color").
</div>

<div class="sop-callout">
  <strong>They have a logo but it's a low-res JPG</strong>
  Ask if they have the original AI/SVG. If not, recreate the logo as a vector for them — quick win and builds goodwill. Add to project Drive in the <code>assets/logo/</code> folder.
</div>

<h2>Exit criteria</h2>
<p>Kickoff done, all required assets received (or photographer scheduled), repo and Drive folder created, Cloudflare Pages project live (even if empty), launch date locked. Design phase starts the next business day. Move to <a href="/sop/design/">phase 05</a>.</p>
